        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: 3D Wayfinder\n- Concepts: indoor wayfinding software, universities, higher education, research, academic degrees\n- Places: shopping centers, airports, train stations, hospitals, universities\n\nFacts:\n- 3D Wayfinder is an indoor wayfinding software and service that helps visitors navigate large public buildings.\n- 3D Wayfinder is used in shopping centers, airports, train stations, hospitals, and universities.\n- A university is an institution of higher or tertiary education and research.\n- A university awards academic degrees in various academic disciplines.\n- The term university comes from the Latin word \"universitas,\" meaning \"a whole.\"",
